{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>But indeed</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, ואך אם טמאה ארץ אחוזתכם, and ואך את הדבר. To teach: just as it is forbidden to kill oneself, so too it is forbidden to curse oneself — and it is ואך את דמכם לנפשותיכם and ואך את הדבר, that even speech I will demand. ואך אם טמאה — to teach that for every animal I will demand it, whether unclean or clean."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:51.001482689Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}